Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Three parts of objective function (look at d prime cost \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]reducing as well\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], seems a \
little like jump in both the beginning and end)
Not sure I quite understand the d\[CloseCurlyQuote] prime coming down. Why \
would that happen if it had a higher d prime for lower food reward?!!\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.908985918371891*^9, 3.908985950364428*^9}, {
